1287
01:21:18,206 --> 01:21:20,106
This famous linguist
once said,

1288
01:21:20,175 --> 01:21:23,736
that of all the phrases
in the English language...

1289
01:21:23,845 --> 01:21:26,313
of all the endless
combinations...

1290
01:21:26,414 --> 01:21:28,314
of words
in all of history,

1291
