that "cellar door"
is the most beautiful.

1292
01:21:34,055 --> 01:21:36,023
Donnie:
"Cellar door"?

1293
01:22:07,656 --> 01:22:09,954
I promise
that one day

1294
01:22:10,025 --> 01:22:12,118
everything's going
to be better for you.

1295
01:22:14,029 --> 01:22:16,497
Chut up!

1296
01:22:29,210 --> 01:22:31,440
