No.

1298
01:22:33,415 --> 01:22:36,873
Dr. Thurman: I want to talk about...
you and your parents.

1299
01:22:38,053 --> 01:22:38,320
Donnie:
They didn't buy me

1300
01:22:38,320 --> 01:22:40,254
Donnie:
They didn't buy me

1301
01:22:40,322 --> 01:22:41,846
what I wanted
for Christmas.

1302
01:22:41,923 --> 01:22:45,017
What did you want
for Christmas that year?

1303
01:22:46,094 --> 01:22:47,925
"Hungry, Hungry Hippos."

1304
01:22:50,799 --> 01:22:52,460
How did you feel,

1305
01:22:52,534 --> 01:22:55,526
