these "Hungry, Hungry Hippos"?

1306
01:22:55,603 --> 01:22:57,628
Regret.

1307
01:22:57,706 --> 01:23:00,368
What else
makes you feel regret?

1308
01:23:02,644 --> 01:23:04,737
That I did it again.

1309
01:23:06,181 --> 01:23:07,876
You did it again?

1310
01:23:07,949 --> 01:23:10,577
I flooded my school

1311
01:23:10,652 --> 01:23:14,315
and I burned down
that pervert's house.

1312
01:23:14,389 --> 01:23:16,289
(laughing)

1313
01:23:16,358 --> 01:23:19,054
I only have a few days left
before they catch me.

1314
01:23:19,127 --> 01:23:21,595
